Delimited comments

```
foo {% bar %} baz
.
<p>foo  baz</p>
```

```
*bo{% c %}ld* text
.
<p><strong>bold</strong> text</p>
```

```
a {% one
two %} b
.
<p>a  b</p>
```

```
a {% oops
.
<p>a {% oops</p>
```

```
a {% one {% two %} b
.
<p>a  b</p>
```

```
Run `a {% x %} b` then done.
.
<p>Run <code>a {% x %} b</code> then done.</p>
```

```
a \{% not a comment %} b
.
<p>a {% not a comment %} b</p>
```

```
| a {% hidden %} b | c |
|---|---|
| d %% tail | e |
.
<table>
  <thead>
    <tr><th scope="col">a  b</th><th scope="col">c</th></tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
    <tr><td>d</td><td>e</td></tr>
  </tbody>
</table>
```
